 *    - Ensure pagination and data returned are valid
 * 2. Retrieve users filtering by username (if at least one user exists):
 *    - Confirm all returned users match the filter
 * 3. Request with invalid pagination params:
 *    a) Negative page number (page = -1)
 *    b) Excessive page size (limit = 10000)
 *    - Should return validation or HTTP errors
 */
