 *
 * Step-by-step Process:
 * 1. Create multiple orders (with different users/carts/timestamps)
 * 2. List all orders with no filters; validate count and pagination
 * 3. List orders filtered by user_id
 * 4. List orders filtered by cart_id
 * 5. List orders by created_after/created_before
 * 6. Test pagination (multiple pages)
 * 7. Filter by status (valid and non-existent)
